      <div type="clause" n="6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ger">Ger</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Symle he sceal his hyrmen scyr pan mid manunge to hlafordes neode .7 him eac leanian be ðam ðe hy earnian .</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Similarly, he must inspire his underlings with admonishments to the lord’s need, and reward each of them as they merit.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[6] Symle he sceal his hyrmen scyrpan mid manunge to hlafordes neode 7 him eac leanian be ðam ðe hy earnian.</ab>
